r active development. Every alpha release may include breaking changes. Pin exact versions during alpha.",[468,481,482,483,487],{},"Fluent adds checkout builders, subscription operations, customer bindings, and a webhook processing pipeline to ",[484,485,486],"code",{},"vatly\u002Fvatly-api-php",". You keep your database and framework. Fluent calls your storage contracts to save orders and subscriptions.",[489,490,492],"h2",{"id":491},"start-a-subscription","Start a subscription",[468,494,495,496,499],{},"Install the package using ",[497,498,173],"a",{"href":174},". This function creates a hosted checkout and returns the URL to send to the browser:",[501,502,507],"pre",{"className":503,"code":504,"language":505,"meta":506,"style":506},"language-php shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","use Vatly\\Fluent\\CustomerProfile;\nuse Vatly\\Fluent\\Vatly;\n\nfunction subscriptionCheckout(string $apiKey, string $customerId, string $planId): string\n{\n    $vatly = Vatly::apiOnly($apiKey);\n    $checkout = $vatly->subscriptionBuilder(new CustomerProfile(vatlyId: $customerId))\n        ->toPlan($planId)\n        ->withRedirectUrlSuccess('https:\u002F\u002Fapp.example.com\u002Fbilling\u002Freturn')\n        ->withRedirectUrlCanceled('https:\u002F\u002Fapp.example.com\u002Fbilling\u002Fcanceled')\n        ->create();\n\n    return $checkout->links->checkoutUrl->href;\n}\n","php","",[484,508,509,537,555,562,611,617,646,690,706,727,746,757,762,791],{"__ignoreMap":506},[510,511,514,518,522,526,529,531,534],"span",{"class":512,"line":513},"line",1,[510,515,517],{"class":516},"sbssI","use",[510,519,521],{"class":520},"sTEyZ"," Vatly",[510,523,525],{"class":524},"sMK4o","\\",[510,527,528],{"class":520},"Fluent",[510,530,525],{"class":524},[510,532,533],{"class":520},"CustomerProfile",[510,535,536],{"class":524},";\n",[510,538,540,542,544,546,548,550,553],{"class":512,"line":539},2,[510,541,517],{"class":516},[510,543,521],{"class":520},[51